      en: ["Highest peak: Brezovo polje at 984 meters.", "Highest point in the entire Slavonia region.", "Geologically composed of ancient crystalline rocks.", "Home to the Omanovac mountain hut at 655 meters.", "Served as a strategic location during Operation Flash in 1995.", "Abundant in natural water springs and streams."],
